  s0: No Git repository
  s1: Nothing staged
  s2: Drafting
  s3: Candidates shown
  s4: The draft failed
  s5: Candidates, index changed
  s6: Copied
  s7: Filled into the commit box
  s8: Staging changed, refused
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you open a repository
  s1 --> s2: you stage a change
  s2 --> s3: the model returns candidates
  s2 --> s4: the draft fails
  s3 --> s5: you change the index
  s3 --> s6: you copy a candidate
  s3 --> s7: you fill the commit box
  s4 --> s1: you start again
  s5 --> s8: you copy after the index changed or you fill after the index changed
  s6 --> s1: you start again
  s7 --> s1: you start again
  s8 --> s1: you start again
